#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1364 expect=skipped domain=DM
#note "FRESH: DM deliberately carries no ARMNRS column at all. Predicted silent: EC-43/Fix #139 folds the absent column to all-missing at the leaf, so the exact-membership operand ARMNRS yields \"\" and the positive containment test is false. DISCRIMINATING scenario -- if it fires, escalate to stage R rather than re-pin. PLAN-retire-corpus-transforms phase 4: the rule now declares the gate variable in Requirements.Variables.All, so the absent column takes the auditable SKIP this scenario pins (Fix #330 remedy: a presence rule reports the absence once)."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset DM label="Demographics"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col ACTARMCD type=Char label="Actual Arm Code"
col ACTARM   type=Char label="Description of Actual Arm"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | DM | 01-701-1015 | A | Arm A
